  "scope": "Product initial group evaluation, capture progression and final scalar coordination delegate to explicit hooks on the original evaluator, native builder and successor proof. Exact outcome reexports preserve borrowed effects and moved captured bindings; saved meters, prefix preflight, refusal precedence and journal authority remain unchanged.",
  "limitations": [
    "Inputs and hooks are trusted execution boundaries: bounded admission, authentic receipts, complete group state and current native authority remain required. Prepared typed output is not dispatch or settlement authority.",
